<div class="min-h-screen bg-ink text-parchment">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-paprika">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl leading-tight text-parchment">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-parchment-dim">Last updated: 13 October 2026</p>
    <nav class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-sm" aria-label="Legal documents">
      <a href="/privacy_policy" class="text-paprika underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/terms" class="text-paprika underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Terms of Service</a>
      <a href="/legal" class="text-paprika underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Legal Notice</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-ink-panel2 bg-ink-panel p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-parchment-dim">
      We use a small number of cookies and similar technologies. Strictly necessary cookies are always
      active; analytics are only loaded <strong class="text-parchment">after you accept</strong> on the
      cookie banner, and you can withdraw consent at any time below.
    </div>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-parchment">1. Strictly necessary cookies</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-parchment-dim">
        Required for the site to function. They cannot be switched off.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-panel2 text-left text-parchment-dim">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Cookie</th>
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Purpose</th>
              <th class="py-2 font-medium">Expires</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-parchment-dim">
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-panel2">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs text-parchment">_mehungry_web_key</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4">Keeps you logged in and protects against request forgery</td>
              <td class="py-2">Session</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-parchment">2. Functional cookies</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-parchment-dim">
        Set only when you explicitly choose "Remember me" at login.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-panel2 text-left text-parchment-dim">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Cookie</th>
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Purpose</th>
              <th class="py-2 font-medium">Expires</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-parchment-dim">
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-panel2">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs text-parchment">_mehungry_web_user_remember_me</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4">Keeps you logged in across browser restarts</td>
              <td class="py-2">60 days</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-parchment">3. Analytics cookies (consent required)</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-parchment-dim">
        We use <strong class="text-parchment">Google Analytics 4</strong> to understand how visitors use
        the site. Google acts as our processor and may process this data on servers in the United States;
        international transfers are covered by the safeguards described in our
        <a href="/privacy_policy" class="text-paprika hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>. We also keep
        internal visit records for security and aggregate statistics.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-panel2 text-left text-parchment-dim">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Data</th>
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Purpose</th>
              <th class="py-2 font-medium">Retention</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-parchment-dim">
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-panel2">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs text-parchment">_ga / _ga_* (Google)</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4">Distinguish visitors and sessions for Google Analytics</td>
              <td class="py-2">Up to 2 years</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-parchment-dim">
        These are only set if you click <strong class="text-parchment">Accept</strong> on the cookie banner.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-parchment-dim">
        We also keep an <strong class="text-parchment">anonymous session counter</strong> — a daily
        tally of visits and total time on site. It stores no IP address, cookie, browser, or
        identifier of any kind, so it runs regardless of your cookie choice.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-parchment">4. Withdraw consent</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-parchment-dim">
        You can withdraw your analytics consent at any time. This stops future analytics collection and
        removes your visitor identifier from your session.
      </p>
      <form action="/cookie-consent/decline" method="post" class="mt-4">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value={Plug.CSRFProtection.get_csrf_token()} />
        <input type="hidden" name="_method" value="post" />
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="btn btn-outline btn-sm border-ink-panel2 text-parchment hover:bg-ink-panel"
        >
          Withdraw analytics consent
        </button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
